# Project Rules — Aegis OSINT AI

# Global shared configuration lives in D:\Vault and applies to every project.
# The global rules are ALREADY loaded automatically via the Cline global
# rules junction (Documents\Cline\Rules -> D:\Vault\Rules). This file only adds
# project-specific context.

Shared resources (use them, never duplicate them into the project):
- Rules:     D:\Vault\Rules\       (core.md, security.md, coding.md, architecture.md, debugging.md)
- Skills:    D:\Vault\Skills\      (go.md, python.md, node.md, rust.md, java.md, devops.md, webapp.md, security.md, reverse-engineering.md)
- MCPs:      D:\Vault\MCPs\        (version-pinned MCP servers)
- Prompts:   D:\Vault\Prompts\
- Templates: D:\Vault\Templates\

Hard requirements (from D:\Vault\Rules\core.md):
- NEVER install, clone, download, or cache anything on C: or in AppData.
- Caches/temp: D:\stany\AgentData (npm-cache, pnpm-store, model-cache, temp).
- Project dependencies (.venv, node_modules) stay local to the project.
- New shared tools/MCP servers go to D:\Vault, version-pinned.

# --- Project-specific rules ---

